Begin3
Title:          HX DOS Extender
Version:        2.19
Entered-Date:   2022-04-01
Description:    Run HX DOS extended or Win32 console applications in DOS.
Summary:        HX DOS extender runtime allows to run HX DOS extended or Win32
                console applications in DOS. Furthermore there is limited
                support for running Win32 graphics applications (DirectDraw,
                GDI, OpenGL).
Keywords:       DOS, Windows, DPMI
Author:         Andreas "Japheth" Grech
Primary-Site:   https://github.com/Baron-von-Riedesel/HX
Platforms:      DOS, FreeDOS
Copying-Policy: Freeware w/sources
Modified-Date:  2022-08-05.2
End
